flowchart LR
    SIM["Synthetic simulator<br/>M1 deterministic"]
    ADAPTER["Read-only aircraft adapter<br/>M2 reviewed lab path"]
    INGEST["Telemetry ingestion service<br/>authenticate • stamp receipt<br/>validate • normalize • dedupe<br/>order-check • classify"]
    HISTORY[("Telemetry history<br/>accepted samples + outcomes")]
    LATEST[("Latest-state projection<br/>one current view per aircraft")]
    API["Management API<br/>versioned queries • authz<br/>freshness projection • audit"]
    UI["Management UI<br/>fleet • detail • history<br/>maintenance • data status"]
    INVENTORY[("Aircraft inventory<br/>source registrations")]
    MAINT[("Maintenance + audit<br/>human-managed records")]
    OPS["Operators / maintainers"]

    SIM -->|synthetic telemetry v1| INGEST
    ADAPTER -->|normalized read-only telemetry v1| INGEST
    INGEST -->|accepted samples + outcomes| HISTORY
    INGEST -->|current sample if ordering rule permits| LATEST
    HISTORY --> API
    LATEST --> API
    INVENTORY <--> API
    MAINT <--> API
    API -->|HTTPS JSON| UI
    UI -->|reviewed record actions| API
    OPS --> UI

    classDef source fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#111827
    classDef service fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#111827
    classDef store fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,color:#111827
    classDef client fill:#fdf2f8,stroke:#db2777,color:#111827
    class SIM,ADAPTER source
    class INGEST,API service
    class HISTORY,LATEST,INVENTORY,MAINT store
    class UI,OPS client

    %% No management-to-aircraft command edge exists by design.
